  "metadata": {
    "title": "R-280 'Novorossiya' Highway Corridor (Reference Map Route, Buffer Zone & Full Rostov–Crimea Network)",
    "description": "Geospatial (WGS84) GeoJSON dataset of the R-280 ('Novorossiya') / E58 road corridor traced from the ACLED reference map (Novoazovsk border through Mariupol, Berdiansk, Melitopol, Henichesk, Chonhar, Dzhankoy, Simferopol, and Feodosia to Kerch), plus the Rostov-on-Don–Taganrog mainland section, the 20 km corridor buffer polygon, and 12 key cities and bridge crossings.",
